, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nSuite notre échange de ce jour, tu trouveras ci-joint les cahiers des charges du client pour :</div>\\n<ul data-editing-info=\\"{&quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&quot;:false,&quot;unorderedStyleType&quot;:2}\\" style=\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\">1 conteneur 20'DRY OUTILLAGE</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\">1 conteneur 20'DRY BUREAU</div>\\n</li></ul>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nMerci de nous rendre ton budget enveloppe pour les 2 conteneurs, d'ici demain, jeudi 27 août.</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div id=\\"Signature\\" class=\\"elementToProof\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<p class=\\"elementToProof\\" s