e, la ou ajd on en a 2. Et comme on &agrave; 3 corner comme celui-ci il en faudrait 3.</p><p>[cid:164675b8-de9d-4626-8c63-02b37de374de]</p><p>Peux-tu stp &eacute;galement me faire une option ou un autre devis avec :<br/>Corner 1 : 2 meubles de 3m de long X 1m de large<br/>Corner 2 : 1 meuble de 2860 m de long X 1m de large et 1 meuble de 1430 m de long X 1m de large<br/>Corner 3 : 1 meuble de 3m de long X 1m de large</p><p>Il n&apos;y a aucune urgence, mais je te fais la demande tant que jy pense,</p><p>Merci beaucoup</p><p>Bonne journ&eacute;e</p><p>Jeanne VEKEMANS<br/>Charg&eacute;e de communication</p><p>[img] +33 7 72 72 58 50<br/>[img] +33 7 72 72 58 50</p><p><a href=\\"mailto:jeanne.vekemans@gerflor.com\\">jeanne.vekemans@gerflor.com</a>&lt;<a href=\\"mailto:jeanne.vekemans@gerflor.com\\">mailto:jeanne.vekemans@gerflor.com</a>&gt;</p><p>[GERFLOR SAS]<br/>[linkedin]&lt;<a href=\\"https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABAAAAAABhfFFA.IuOSGxWyBVM\\">https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABAAAAAABhfFFA.IuOSGxWyBVM</a>&gt;<br/>[facebook]&lt;<a href=\\"https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAAA4AAAAABhfFFA.540qF2GrBvg\\">https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAAA4AAAAABhfFFA.540qF2GrBvg</a>&gt;<br/>[instagram]&lt;<a href=\\"https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABIAAAAABhfFFA.7FTjlmMI7EU\\">https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABIAAAAABhfFFA.7FTjlmMI7EU</a>&gt;<br/>[youtube]&lt;<a href=\\"https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABMAAAAABhfFFA.EcDqZAYhBXo\\">https://app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABMAAAAABhfFFA.EcDqZAYhBXo</a>&gt;</p><p>[FR - INTL Taralay Initial 2026]</p><p>This e-mail message and any attachment hereto are intended only for the above-mentioned recipient(s). Their contents are confidential. If you received this e-mail in error, please notify us immediately, and delete it as well as any attachment, without making any copy, nor disclosing the contents, nor taking any action based thereon. Thank you.<br/>Please consider the environment before printing this e-mail.</p>","RE: Meubles M